30+ new tracks from the talents of the Synthwave and Darksynth genres.<br>Composed exclusively for Nitro Kid by:<br>- LudoWic (Katana Zero OST)<br>- Tonebox<br>- Jules Reves<br>- Laird Kruger<br><br>OST is available for purchase separately or in the Turbo Bundle with Nitro Kid.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/c5550aaa0feaa9fc6889d2c5e57e3e95.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/c5550aaa0feaa9fc6889d2c5e57e3e95.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/c5550aaa0feaa9fc6889d2c5e57e3e95.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>RETROFUTURE ESSENCE</strong><br> <br>It has everything we love about the 80’s with cyberpunk, retrowave, and classic action movie references. Can you catch all the easter eggs we hid?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/12c3b50bfb6d2a39ae018026480e3338.avif?t=1739398923\" width=576 height=215 /></span><br><strong>THREE UNIQUE AGENTS</strong><br><br>Pick your special agent. Every one of them has a unique set of cards, abilities, and playstyles.<br><br><strong>L33</strong> — Fluid fighter dedicated to martial arts and the power of the elements. <br>When Kung fu isn’t enough, you ignite in fury, burning enemies down (<i>quite literally</i>).<br><br><strong>J4X</strong> — Heavy-hitter thinking like a chess player. <br>Tank with the unique ability to counter-attack during enemy turns. Build up Combo and Pressure points for devastating knock-outs!<br><br><strong>K31</strong> — Professional assassin, the best at tech and weaponry.<br>Possessing two different stances for ranged and close combat. Each stance comes with unique perks and limitations. Use your ammo wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d8298e1911b63160c313d04c95244d6c.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d8298e1911b63160c313d04c95244d6c.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d8298e1911b63160c313d04c95244d6c.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>10 SECURITY LEVELS FOR A REAL CHALLENGE</strong><br><br>Every time you clear INFINITY tower – a new Security Level is unlocked.<br>Each of them brings tougher challenges your way. Will you make it to the mysterious <i>Creator</i>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/eb95944393806246b2d9c41cce8307b8.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/eb95944393806246b2d9c41cce8307b8.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/eb95944393806246b2d9c41cce8307b8.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>NITRO KID FEATURES</strong><br><br>- 3 unlockable Agents<br>- 250+ Cards<br>- 3 unique Acts (stages of INFINITY tower)<br>- Security Levels for difficulty progression<br>- 50+ Unique Enemies<br>- 50+ Events<br>- 30+ Infusions<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_